{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:00 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:00 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:00 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"新皇崗口岸周邊已有大型APEC花壇、電子屏幕等。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0257fd3e0710d3698ad903b3cae55dd/2026-10/544_-_2026-10-11T094331_298.jpg\"/><p>亞太經合組織（APEC）第三十三次領導人非正式會議將於11月18日至19日在深圳舉行。央視新聞報道，為持續便利亞太區域商務人員往來，中方決定將APEC商務旅行卡持卡人在華最長停留期由60天延長至90天，自2026年11月1日起實施。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:31:32.900935+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:39.396336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:21:42.479339+00:00","content_hash":"1d5135bd651741d218be863b108adf08a173f3dc9f4f88090b959896e707c4a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}